        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Report CJ-603 was listed as a BRIDGE inspection in W06-S02. According to W06-S03, it should have gone to Structures, but W06-S04 shows it was sent to Electrical instead. This confirms a routing issue, but we don&#39;t have enough information to know what caused it.Report CJ-603 was listed as a BRIDGE inspection in W06-S02. According to W06-S03, it should have gone to Structures, but W06-S04 shows it was sent to Electrical instead. This confirms a routing issue, but we don&#39;t have enough information to know what caused it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Was the Routing Table (D2) set up correctly when CJ-603 was processed?Was the Routing Table (D2) set up correctly when CJ-603 was processed?" vertex="1">
